# 🤖 Baxtiyor AI — IELTS/CEFR Telegram Bot

Shaxsiy ingliz tili va IELTS/CEFR mentor Telegram bot.

## 🚀 Xususiyatlar

- 🧠 AI Chat (shaxsiy xotira bilan)
- 📝 IELTS Writing baholash (band score)
- 🗣 IELTS Speaking baholash (ovozdan)
- 🎧 IELTS Listening mashqlari
- 📖 IELTS Reading mashqlari
- 📚 CEFR daraja testi (A1-C2)
- 🧪 CAT adaptiv joylashish testi
- 🔄 Ingliz ↔ O'zbek tarjima
- 📖 So'z tushuntirish (CEFR, IELTS usefulness)
- ⭐ Shaxsiy lug'at va quiz
- 🎙 Ovozli javob (STT/TTS)
- 📈 Progress kuzatuv
- 👨‍💼 Admin panel

---

## 📦 O'rnatish

### 1. Loyihani yuklab oling

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/baxtiyor-ai-bot.git
cd baxtiyor-ai-bot
```

### 2. Virtual muhit yarating

```bash
python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate   # Linux/Mac
venv\Scripts\activate      # Windows
```

### 3. Kutubxonalarni o'rnating

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### 4. .env faylini sozlang

```bash
cp .env.example .env
```

Keyin `.env` faylini oching va quyidagilarni to'ldiring:

- `BOT_TOKEN` — [@BotFather](https://t.me/BotFather) dan oling
- `AI_API_KEY_1` — OpenAI API key (yoki boshqa OpenAI-compatible)
- `ADMIN_IDS` — Sizning Telegram ID ingiz

### 5. Botni ishga tushiring

```bash
python bot.py
```

---

## ☁️ Render.com ga deploy qilish

### 1. GitHub ga push qiling

```bash
git add .
git commit -m "Initial commit"
git push
```

### 2. Render.com da yangi Web Service yarating

- Build Command: `pip install -r requirements.txt`
- Start Command: `python bot.py`
- Environment: Python 3.11

### 3. Environment Variables qo'shing

Render dashboard > Environment bo'limida barcha `.env` o'zgaruvchilarini qo'shing.

### 4. PostgreSQL qo'shing (ixtiyoriy)

Render > New PostgreSQL > yarating.
`DATABASE_URL` ni Render bergan Internal Database URL ga o'zgartiring.

